### Local configuration ###
# Never commit credentials or machine-specific overrides. The compose file and
# application.yml carry defaults that work out of the box; anything that differs
# on one machine stays on that machine.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.local
**/application-local.yml
**/application-local.properties
